        <detaileddescription>
<para>Loads a sound effect from file, with caching.</para>
<para>If the sound is already loaded, returns the cached instance. Otherwise, loads the file and stores it in the cache.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>filepath</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Path to the WAV file. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Shared pointer to the loaded <ref refid="classSoundEffect" kindref="compound">SoundEffect</ref>, or nullptr on failure.</para>
</simplesect>
If the sound is already in the cache, returns the cached shared pointer. Otherwise, creates a new <ref refid="classSoundEffect" kindref="compound">SoundEffect</ref> instance, loads the file, and stores it.</para>
