    <briefdescription>
<para>Manager for loading, caching, and playing sound effects. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides a centralized interface for sound management, ensuring that sound files are loaded only once and reused across multiple playback requests. </para>
